ing, shallow depth of field, fine film grain, stable framing. Do not settle or freeze at the end; the action is still in progress on the last frame. The video starts exactly from the given first frame and evolves from it. Every character keeps exactly the same facial features, hairstyle, hair colour, build and costume as shown in the character reference images for the entire clip, without drifting or deforming. No on-screen text, no subtitles, no captions, no watermark, no graphics.\noverall_soundscape: Wind rustles the old locust leaves, donkey hooves thud on the broad loose yellow-dirt road, and one or two distant dog barks drift across the village entrance. Cloth swishes softly as the body turns. Dry paper crackles faintly.\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 36, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 8, "widgets_values_named": {"prompt": "The target video starts from the given first frame at the 0.00-second mark: the opening composition is exactly that frame and must not jump away from it.\nReference images and their roles — Image 1 = the location (environment reference: keep the place, its layout and the light exactly as shown in this image); Image 2 = the on-screen characters (appearance reference: keep every face, hairstyle, build and costume exactly as shown in this image); Image 3 = the spatial layout (a top-down schematic diagram, do NOT render it into the picture; use it only to fix who stands on the left/right, their facing, distance and which side the camera is on).\nintegrated_multimodal_description:\n[Shot 1] Late-afternoon warm sunlight slants across the earthen village entrance, and the old locust tree casts sharp shadows. On the right, He Zhizhang holds the donkey reins and walks toward the village, his arm swinging slightly while bla